<title>USA: San Diego USD, Calif., $90 mln TRANs priced.</title>
<headline>San Diego USD, Calif., $90 mln TRANs priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica said Wednesday it priced $90 million of San Diego USD, Calif., tax and revenue anticipation notes (TRANs) with a 4.50 percent coupon and a 4.00 percent yield.</p>
<p>The notes are dated 7/1/1997 and are due 10/1/1998. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
